WEBVTT

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.340
Talk about your war zones!

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:14.340
Evacuation of Santa Marta is complete after a devastating volcanic eruption leveled the famed resort community.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:19.190
Regrettably, the guests had insufficient notice to pack up their valuables.

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:26.160
This ain't right. The lava should have smothered everything on the island.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:37.190
I suggest we visit the main lobby safe first,

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:39.860
and then see about the ones in the luxury suites.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:32.920
I'm sorry.

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:29.050
I can't believe we slept halfway around the world on the word of some freaked out looters.

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:30.000
You quit griping.

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:35.040
How many chances do you get to explore a mutated ecosystem?

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:38.070
Besides, we're not just here on their word.

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:40.860
The head of the resort company requested that we check it out.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.110
And he asked in the universal language:

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:44.690
"Moolah."

00:02:44.690 --> 00:02:49.340
Underwater thermal geysers.

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:52.570
Please, shield someone else.

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:53.940
AHH!

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:03.170
Would you like a hand, Mr. Louganis?

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:06.320
Uh, no, thanks. I'm fine.

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:13.210
This Gilligan has a hankering for Ginger.

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:17.220
Keep it up. We might need someone to sacrifice to the Volcano God.

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:24.200
Nice place. They really used it as a secret nuclear test site in the 50s?

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:25.470
Yeah, underground testing.

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:28.510
Twenty years later, they wised up and started building luxury hotels.

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:30.000
The shield pin is broken.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.000
and there is a leak in the fuel line.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.040
Then I'll make fixing escape my top priority.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:37.020
LC, gather whatever data you can.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:41.220
We're not staying any longer than absolutely necessary.

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:45.000
Normal, normal, and normal.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.920
Shouldn't there be a road here somewhere?

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:48.980
You're looking at it.

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:51.330
How am I supposed to hack my way through that?

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:54.390
You don't. Nigel does.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:02.900
Oh, yeah, this is what you find.

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:03.840
What is that, a B-flat?

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:17.630
Palm-top computers and seawater don't mix.

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:18.810
He's still under warranty.

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:21.170
I can't run Nigel by remote.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:24.040
I guess that means you're coming along.

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:26.530
And we all know how much you love field assignments.

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:30.000
The sooner we finish, the sooner we get off this lit fire.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:35.680
firecracker. Then I shall allow Randy and Dr. Tatopolis to repair the boat while I accompany

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:42.750
you into the jungle. Really? Better to join you now than search for you later. Alrighty

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:51.640
troops, forward march! This island should be covered with ash, not vegetation. Something

00:04:51.640 --> 00:05:00.000
inside the ash must be acting as a super fertilizer. This pollen's killing my situses. Is

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.120
Is there nothing he is not allergic to?

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:03.010
Nope.

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:08.380
Ah, Mandel.

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:10.040
They're alive!

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:12.640
Okay, calm down. Take it easy.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:14.540
You're just tangle, that's all.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:21.130
Then what's making all that noise?

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:28.890
Perhaps this is why the looters thought the plants were attacking.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:30.000
It's possible.

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:34.670
This genus is like nothing. I've ever seen let's gather some samples

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:39.990
Then I shall move on I'll catch up to you both at Hotel Roe wait a minute

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:47.160
Nick would never consider splitting us up. Yeah, but sadly Nicky isn't in on this little jaunt come on go

00:05:47.160 --> 00:06:00.000
I'll be fine. Well, it isn't pretty, but it should get us back to the secret. Oh, somebody's talking

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:06.320
rumbly's getting mighty rumbly. Nick to Elsie. Gather your things and return to the boat.

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:11.710
We're pulling out. No can do, worm guy. I am literally up a tree. And Craven and the

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:16.130
French Fire are checking into the hotels. I want you all here. We're pulling back to

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:30.000
a safe distance until... Come again? I can't hear you, Nicky. That's interesting. How about we have Nigel

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.980
go in for a look-see.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:34.240
That's just what I'm aiming to do, pilgrim.

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:37.840
Note to self, obliterate hacker.

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:00.000
That's her!

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:07.040
- Monique, Graven, does anybody read me?

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:08.330
- Something's wrong.

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:10.180
- These things are growing out of control.

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:33.910
Can I just say how psyched I am about his habit of tailing you?

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:08.040
Toasting is like marshmallows!

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:09.600
Can't you make 'em stop?

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:11.560
I can't make 'em do anything!

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:19.140
What is this stuff?

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:21.250
Probably some kind of sap.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:29.000
Find something, anything to cut with.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.040
totally not working.

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:40.100
If we don't get Godzilla free, these plants are going to strangle him.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:44.450
It's safe in here.

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:45.410
Isn't it?

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:47.580
I had to ask.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:55.440
Please try to watch out for yourself.

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:08.750
hmm a viscous liquid sticky exhibiting properties consistent with honey honey

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:21.060
that means bees and to make a hive this big they'd have to be downstairs now

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:27.810
I'm allergic to bee stays what a surprise

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:38.450
Get away!

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:05.710
It's broken.

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:06.710
Monique!

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:07.710
Let me help you with that!

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.360
No!

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:15.880
Maybe the plants have some kind of energy source we can mess with.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:16.850
Wait!

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:18.960
That sensor has a laser sighting, right?

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:20.010
Yeah, why?

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:23.010
Penknife.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.960
Duct tape.

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:29.120
I'm sorry, this gunk doesn't want to come off.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:34.870
I should be able to recalibrate the beam for a low-intensity burn.

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:38.560
Mr. Sulu, set the phasers on slice.

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:42.930
Yahoo! Nice shot, Efe!

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:07.490
Do you have to be a martyr?

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:44.170
that's covered them with some kind of sap and a giant bee carried him away this

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:54.490
just gets better and better we have to find the others Krakatoa had a field day

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:58.100
with this place an eruption doesn't explain what's happened to the plant

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:00.000
life here it does have

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.380
something is in the lava.

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:04.120
Remember those nuclear tests in the 50s?

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:15.600
It's my kind of weed whacker!

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:18.900
These plants are just defending themselves against intruders.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.600
The more Godzilla attacks, the more they attack.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:27.720
I'm gonna go out on a limb here and say the radioactive lava didn't just mutate plants.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.510
It's a vicious cycle.

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:33.050
The bees carry pollen from plant to plant, spreading the mutation,

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:36.760
while the plants feed the bees, mutating more and more of them.

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:46.510
That's where the bee was heading when it took Randy.

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:55.700
Next time, I choose the vacation spot.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.220
where we're going?

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:03.810
- None.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:39.670
Watch out.

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:07.730
- There's something you don't see every day.

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:09.930
- Giant bees and man-eating plants?

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:11.590
- No, Kraven playing Rambo.

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:31.990
So what's with the leg?

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:32.980
Never mind.

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:36.450
You hear that?

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:39.000
Her Majesty's sending for reinforcements.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.660
You're right!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:42.860
He's the one controlling them!

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.080
I have an idea!

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:46.840
He's lost it.

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:56.220
If those bees get to the mainland, they'll spread pollen everywhere!

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:59.600
Giant bees and man-eating plants on every continent.

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:03.690
Do you find any bug spray?

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:11.070
Alright, now just say Randy is in there.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:16.250
How are we gonna find him?

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.630
Can try to talk me out of this.

00:15:18.630 --> 00:15:20.630
Hurry! I can't hold him off forever!

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:25.290
I'm-I'm hurrying.

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:28.770
No fork in us. We're done!

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:52.660
You take down the queen, and you take down the drones.

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.710
C'est très intelligent.

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:02.850
Somehow I'd be happier if we weren't right in the middle.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:16.740
Sure knows a bad thing when he sees it.

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:49.560
accept my help do not see it what anything baby please

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:22.650
Well, that's the end of the killer bees.

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:25.470
And the world's nastiest houseplants.

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:28.410
There's no way Godzilla got off the island alive.

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:39.330
I've said it before and I'll say it again.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:41.430
Never bet against the Lizard King.
